### Create reminder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reminders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bath time",
  "description": "Give baby a bath",
  "time": "2026-09-29T19:00:00"
}

### Test invalid reminder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reminders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "This reminder should not be created",
  "time": "2026-09-29T19:00:00"
}

### Get all reminders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reminders

### Get reminder by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reminders/1

### Update a reminder by ID
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/reminders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bath time",
  "description": "Give baby a bath + pyjamas",
  "time": "2026-10-14T19:30:00"
}

### Delete reminder by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reminders/1